WEBVTT

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:10.750
Starlight...

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:15.830
It's a story of goddesses
drawn by the glow of the heavens.

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:22.830
We can fight and argue and disagree,
but there are ties that bind us together...

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:27.910
Yet we may be pulled from one another,
never to meet again.

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:29.910
It is a sad story.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.410
Let's go! Together, we will grasp that star.

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:53.540
Our dreams will not come to be...

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.290
The tale of these eight women captivates us.

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:06.620
The song of these eight women
draws us in and compels us.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:12.080
Let's go to that stage...

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:14.910
We'll get to that shining star, together!

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:25.450
Idiot.

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:26.700
Why?!

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.250
Karen-chan?

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:37.750
What?!

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:40.660
Hikari...chan?

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:52.420
Revue Starlight

00:01:52.830 --> 00:02:01.160
Ano hoshi o tsukamu no wa daare?
Who, oh who, will be the one to grab hold of the star?

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:08.120
Tou no choujou de
At the very top of that tower

00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:22.500
Shizuka ni tomotta honou ga atsuku mune o kogashite iku
These flames lit in silence fill my chest with a white-hot passion

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.750
Unmei no wa
That's just the Wheel of Fortune

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:32.450
Butai no ue de odorasareteiru wake ja nai
It's not like I'm being forced to dance on this stage

00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:34.660
Tobitate
Spring forth

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:38.540
Tashika ni ano hi mitanda
I'm sure I saw it that day

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:42.160
Hajiketa hoshi no kirameki
The brilliance of a star that has burst open

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:48.620
Iroaseta yakusoku ni yubi ga fureru made
Until my fingers reach out to touch that faded promise

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:52.700
Makuake mae ni hajimaru
It will start before the curtain rises

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:56.250
Me no mae de tsuzurareteku
And be spelled out before our eyes

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:59.830
Umarekawatta watashi wa
Having been reborn

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:03.660
Koko de kimi ni aeta
I was able to meet you here

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:07.330
Mou ichido
Once again

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:23.290
Hikari-chan!

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:26.910
Hikari-chan! Hikari-chan!

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:29.790
K..Karen-chan?

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:32.000
My glasses! My glasses!

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.910
Where did she go?!

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:35.290
Jeez!

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:43.870
Hikari-chan!

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:44.950
Hikari-chan?

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:45.790
Not here!

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:46.750
Or here!

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:47.830
Where is she?

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:49.540
Hikari-chan!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.620
Where are you?!

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:57.000
Maybe I should bend a bit more here...

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:59.080
Do you know where Hikari-chan is?!

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:04.500
What's wrong
with you?!
I don't know
where she is!

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:05.080
I don't understand if you don't speak in Japanese!

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:06.080
Hikari-chan!

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.200
Hey!

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:10.540
Where are you, Hikari-chan?!

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:14.200
She's been raising hell since morning...

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.620
Honestly! It's such a nuisance!

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:19.580
No luck!

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:23.700
Hikari-chan isn't on the roof,
or in the cafeteria, or even in the boiler room!

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.250
You mean Kagura?

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.580
Did you try calling her?

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.500
Banana, nice! Bana-nice!

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:36.080
She didn't even think of that?

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:37.830
Bana-nice...

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:43.660
Hikari-chan?! Hello?

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:46.580
Hikari-chan, where are you right now?

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.120
No way...

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.000
Are you off-campus?

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.950
Did you send an off-campus notice?!

00:04:57.950 --> 00:04:59.620
You know curfew is at 6:00, right?

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:01.450
What I mean is-!

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:09.620
She won't answer!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.500
What is she thinking?!

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:16.830
Do you know where Kagura-san is?

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:19.040
What about your off-campus notice?

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.410
You're in charge of cleaning the hallway today, right?

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:24.660
Sorry! I'll be back!

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:27.910
Karen-chan!

00:05:29.290 --> 00:05:31.580
Jeez! What is she angry about?!

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:36.410
Hikari-chan, where are you?!

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:36.950
Today
Hikari-chan?!
Hikari-chan, where are you?!

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:38.120
Hikari-chan?!
Hikari-chan, where are you?!

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:38.120
Stay away.

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:40.000
"Stay away"?!

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:41.580
Stay away.

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:43.200
Stay away.
Stay away?!

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:44.330
Stay away?!
It's only natural to worry

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:44.330
when you suddenly disappear!

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:45.120
Stay away?!
It's only natural to worry
when you suddenly disappear!
Where are you?

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:51.540
What is this...?

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:56.120
Ah! I know!

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:02.450
I was wrong!

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:14.700
What do you think that is?

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:16.370
They're jellyfish!

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:17.540
That's it!

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:20.580
Thanks so much!

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:34.370
Huh?!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.120
A different aquarium?!

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:08.870
One adult, please!

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:11.290
That will be 1,350 yen.

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:12.500
Huh?!

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:14.040
Um, okay...

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:24.910
What? Whaaat?!

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:28.250
Jeez, again?!

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:36.790
What are you up to, Hikari-chan?

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:40.750
Where is she this time?

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:44.870
Why did you lose?

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.200
Why did you lose?
Sorry...

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:56.700
Sorry...
I... feel like Tendo and I weren't...

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:58.120
Sorry...
I... feel like Tendo and I weren't...

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:58.120
even on the same stage

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:02.450
It's like, they were completely different stages, or...

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:05.200
Ah, if I can even call it a stage...

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:05.580
It's like, they were
completely different stages

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:05.580
Ah, if I can even call

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:06.910
It's like, they were
completely different stages
Ah, if I can even call
Idiot. You're
an idiot, Karen.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.830
Well then, what should I have done?!

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:11.000
Idiot. You're
an idiot, Karen.
Well then what
should I have done?!

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:14.870
Well then what
should I have done?!
I don't know

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:14.330
What do you mean, you don't know?!

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:17.370
I don't know
I don't know either

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:20.160
I don't know
I don't know either
What should we do?

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:22.910
Hikari-chan...

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:27.410
Hikari

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:37.950
It finally went through!

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:39.830
Hikari-chan!

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:43.000
Hey, Karen...

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.250
What?! What?!

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:48.450
Do you remember...

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:50.910
our Starlight?

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:53.290
Huh?

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:59.290
Tatami mats really are calming!

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:02.120
I'd like to live here, not in the dorms...

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:04.790
If the teacher finds you, she's going to give you an earful.

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:09.620
School uniforms must always be worn
when we're on campus...

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:10.830
Jeez, that's way too strict!

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:12.700
Jeez, that's way too strict!

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:16.660
Still, I sure was surprised...

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:22.200
That you're participating in the giraffe's audition, that is.

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.700
I wonder if it's for real...

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:29.790
I mean, a lead that transcends time on the stage of fate...

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:32.250
to become a "Top Star"...

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:35.540
You joined because you believed it too, right?

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:37.580
Well, yeah, I guess...

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:44.450
But what really surprised me is that
you signed up without talking to me about it.

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:48.750
That really puts me in a bind!

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:53.620
It means that I'm gonna have to fight you someday!

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:55.870
Well, when that happens...

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:57.330
let me win, okay?

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:01.750
You're heavy.

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:02.830
Ouch!

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:07.870
Oh, that's right!

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:13.370
Hey, Kaoruko!

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:15.330
Where are you going?

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:17.370
Wait right there.

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.330
Mahiru?

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:25.370
No!

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:28.000
I am the goddess who protects the hallways.

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:32.120
I feel it... There is wicked intent coming from you.

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:34.580
What's going on?

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:35.660
Kaoruko-chan!

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:38.950
This isn't what you're thinking, right?

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:42.080
"Karen and the others
didn't submit an off-campus notice,

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:47.040
so if I tell the teacher, I can get rid of some
rivals thanks to this school rule violation!"

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:49.410
You wouldn't think that, right?!

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:52.790
I-I wouldn't go as far as that!

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:55.330
Well then, how far WOULD you go?

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:58.120
Whoa! Here she comes!

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:58.120
I-I'm sorry!

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:02.790
That's right! I'm the goddess who protects the hallways!

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:05.540
And yet, I am jealous...

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:09.830
Kagura-san has Karen-chan chasing after her!

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:14.290
Our Starlight...

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:17.950
There's no way I would forget that.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.830
Our beginning...

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.790
Our promise.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:28.870
I entered Seisho Music Academy
because of that promise!

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:29.410
KINRYUZAN
KAMINARIMON

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:35.160
It certainly is strict, but I've never thought it was difficult.

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:38.660
That's how it was at the Royal Institute of Dramatic Arts.

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:41.870
Um... The dollar? The mark?

00:11:41.870 --> 00:11:44.330
Or was it the peso...?

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:46.040
Yeah...

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:51.040
It really was always cloudy or raining.
That's the type of city London is.

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:57.660
But even though you promised,
I sent you letters and you never replied!

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:01.250
You still can't eat green peas, can you?

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:03.500
Yeah, I went to see it!

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:06.870
I saved up my allowance.
And it was the first performance, too!

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:12.910
They said that for every new performance I see,
I should watch one of the classics.

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:16.160
A tumbler from "Mister White"?

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:18.620
What? So that was Japan-only, huh?

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:24.160
That's just a rumor. There's actually a lot
of delicious food over there.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:26.410
I know what you mean!

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:28.700
That song in that reunion scene!

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:30.410
It hits you like "BAM!" right?

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:36.150
Monja
Tsukishima
Tsukishima
Specialty

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:35.700
Right. There's a theater there
that was built over 300 years ago.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:39.660
Someday, I'll give you a tour.

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:44.540
I was so happy when you
suddenly transferred to our school.

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:47.410
I remember our promise.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:51.580
I thought I was the only one that remembered.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:54.830
I would never forget that!

00:12:56.830 --> 00:13:00.330
Our beginning was that Starlight.

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:06.040
The promise we both made... is our future.

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:13.200
I never forgot that.

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:17.200
I thought that somehow, it would one day come true.

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:23.450
But I didn't have enough passion
to become a Stage Girl...

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.450
We all understand it.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.500
The passion from standing on the stage...

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:34.660
The future that can only be found from that place...

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:37.370
The moment that can only be shared at that place...

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:42.000
My body and soul are crying out for the stage...

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:46.370
To go even higher, try even harder...

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:48.660
To reach Position Zero.

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:54.040
That's why I'll light that fire one more time.

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:59.700
It was the first time I felt moved,
an excitement I'd never felt before.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.500
This was where we made that promise...

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:12.330
to stand tall in the world of Stage Girls!

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:32.700
You took your time.

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:42.290
Sorry I made you wait...

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:44.000
Hikari-chan.

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.870
Care to do it together?

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.660
You're back on point, aren't you?

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.040
You've inspired a fighting spirit in me.

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:09.950
That's nice.

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:13.080
What's with you, anyway?

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:16.410
You already take center stage, singing and dancing...

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:18.160
Why do you have to do the auditions too?!

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:22.790
I'm extremely jealous, you know. More than anyone.

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:23.660
Huh?

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:33.950
Having someone other than me becoming the Top Star...

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:38.250
Just thinking about it makes me feel
I'll go mad with jealousy.

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:41.750
You really are greedy.

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:44.700
TOWER AQUARIUM
Today, services will end
at 8:00 PM for equipment inspection.

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:44.750
Oh, man.

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:48.700
TOWER AQUARIUM
Today, services will end
at 8:00 PM for equipment inspection.

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:47.580
Jellyfish...

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:55.910
You wanted to see the jellyfish, right?

00:15:57.120 --> 00:16:00.580
But I hope we can come here again, together!

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.500
That audition...

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:07.580
If you don't pass, then it's all over.

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:11.250
You'll lose the most important thing for a Stage Girl.

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:14.750
The most... important thing?

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:17.950
That's why you can't lose.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:21.500
You really are amazing, Hikari-chan.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:24.790
You know everything that I don't!

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:27.910
That's why you locked me up!

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:32.620
Still, that's not enough to make me lose.

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:33.540
Huh?

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:38.450
Or, maybe you didn't get that.

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:42.660
I didn't expect that of you, Hikari-chan.

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:44.540
Wh-what?

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:47.410
Thanks, Hikari-chan.

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:48.870
Huh?

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:51.910
I won't lose again.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:56.290
I'll shine so that I can stand on that stage!

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:58.660
I'll be so intense and radiant...

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:01.660
I won't lose to anyone!

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:08.120
Stage Girl Karen Aijo is getting better
day by day, ya know!

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:09.450
Karen...

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:14.790
But in this audition, only one person can pass.

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:17.250
Someday, you and I will...

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:19.750
So then, let's pass it together!

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:21.120
Huh?

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:25.660
The giraffe never said only one person can pass.

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:29.040
"The one who presents us
with the most dazzling of revues,"

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:31.120
and blah blah, something something.

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:34.040
There's no way we'd get that kind of special treatment!

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:41.120
It's okay.

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:43.250
Karen...

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:51.830
Maybe we would.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:54.080
Right? Right?!

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:04.410
You're right.

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:07.660
If the two of us can shine the brightest, then I'm sure...

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:12.080
Yup! For sure.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:34.370
Junna Hoshimi, Nana Daiba, present.

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:37.120
Hoshimi and Daiba...

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:39.370
Next! Step up for roll call!

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:46.250
M-Mahiru Tsuyuzaki, Karen Aijo,
and Hikari Kagura, present!

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:50.000
What happened to Aijo and Kagura?

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:56.120
Well, I guess they did so much individual practice
that they're all tired now.

00:18:56.950 --> 00:18:59.250
I can't believe we're doing this...

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.790
Next! Roll call!

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:04.860
Futaba Isurugi
Kaoruko Hanayagi

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:04.580
Oh, no! Saijo-san!

00:19:05.730 --> 00:19:09.120
The weather
is nice today

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:11.450
What on Earth happened?

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:13.410
It must be her stage fright.

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:14.160
What?

00:19:14.490 --> 00:19:18.620
Parisians are
always popular,
forever...

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:22.500
Maybe I
should do
something...

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:22.540
But you mustn't!

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:27.160
Futaba Isurugi, Kaoruko Hanayagi, present!

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.660
Ah. Okay, yeah...

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:29.620
You're
welcome

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:32.200
How long are you going to keep doing this?

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:33.370
Huh?

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:39.040
I've suddenly recovered! Tres bien.

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:41.330
I-I see...

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:46.250
It was my first time doing that, but...

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:48.370
Bana-nice!

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:50.160
We won't be doing that again.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:52.080
I can't believe we made up an alibi!

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:14.410
Karen-chan!

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:21.120
Karen-chan!

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:24.160
Jeez, you guys!

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:26.950
What were you thinking, staying out all night?!

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:32.000
We ran out of money.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.620
But we made it back by 6:00!

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:37.120
That doesn't mean 6:00 in the morning!

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:40.080
Do you know how much trouble
you've caused everyone?!

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:43.120
Junna-chan had to do your cleaning duties for you.

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:48.950
Sorry, Jun-jun!

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:51.290
I'll do your next 10 cleaning duties for you!

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:53.160
Good grief!

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:57.790
Kagura and Aijo, come to the staff room later.

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:00.580
And bring everyone who covered for you.

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:05.580
You'll have some traditional hardcore training
as punishment!

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:09.160
T-traditional hardcore training?

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:10.700
What's that?

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:12.700
It's an unbelievably strict form of training,

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:15.290
one that's been passed down at Seisho
throughout the years!

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:20.750
They say a huge number of our senpai
have left because they couldn't handle it.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:22.250
But we'll be okay!

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:25.040
As long as we're together... right?

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:28.370
I can't help but think it's a certain SOMEONE'S fault
that this has happened!

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:29.370
Jeez...

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:31.080
At any rate...

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:35.160
I'm just glad you guys are safe.

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:36.040
Welcome back.

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:39.620
Welcome back, Hikari-chan.

00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:42.790
You too, Karen-chan. Welcome back.

00:21:43.160 --> 00:21:44.540
I'm glad you're back.

00:21:45.270 --> 00:21:46.770
Welcome
back

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:49.040
Don't just take off like that.

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:50.620
You're not Kaoruko, you know.

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:53.080
I wouldn't do something like that!

00:21:57.500 --> 00:22:00.250
